      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Montagio · Talking avatar\n\nA portrait and a speech file give a talking clip: Wan 2.2 S2V in 4 steps. This graph renders one 5 s chunk; Montagio chains up to three for 15 s.\n\n**Tip:** In Montagio the speech comes from a Chatterbox voice job (a pinned, patched custom node); here, load any consented speech as `speech.flac`.\n\n**Models**, under `ComfyUI/models/`:\n- `diffusion_models/wan2.2_s2v_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Wan-AI/Wan2.2-S2V-14B)\n- `text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from google/umt5-xxl)\n- `vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P)\n- `audio_encoders/wav2vec2_large_english_fp16.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from jonatasgrosman/wav2vec2-large-xlsr-53-english)\n- `loras/wan2.2_t2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1.1_high_noise.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from lightx2v/Wan2.2-Lightning)\n\nCore nodes only. 127 to 145 s for 3 to 4 s of speech on an NVIDIA L4 (24 GB), peak 21.7 GB.\n\nOpen weights only: every file is Apache-2.0 or MIT, pinned by sha256 in Montagio's `registry/models.lock.yaml`."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Montagio · Talking avatar\n\nA portrait and a speech file give a talking clip: Wan 2.2 S2V in 4 steps. This graph renders one 5 s chunk; Montagio chains up to three for 15 s.\n\n**Tip:** In Montagio the speech comes from a Chatterbox voice job (a pinned, patched custom node); here, load any consented speech as `speech.flac`.\n\n**Models**, under `ComfyUI/models/`:\n- `diffusion_models/wan2.2_s2v_14B_fp8_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Wan-AI/Wan2.2-S2V-14B)\n- `text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from google/umt5-xxl)\n- `vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from Wan-AI/Wan2.1-I2V-14B-480P)\n- `audio_encoders/wav2vec2_large_english_fp16.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from jonatasgrosman/wav2vec2-large-xlsr-53-english)\n- `loras/wan2.2_t2v_lightx2v_4steps_lora_v1.1_high_noise.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from lightx2v/Wan2.2-Lightning)\n\nCore nodes only. 127 to 145 s for 3 to 4 s of speech on an NVIDIA L4 (24 GB), peak 21.7 GB.\n\nOpen weights only: every file is Apache-2.0 or MIT, pinned by sha256 in Montagio's `registry/models.lock.yaml`."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
